Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:22.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她却理解为  我觉得她像只母牛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:26.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, walk us through it,honey. Walk us through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:26.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  情景重现一下  重现一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.10,0:05:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, Janice said,"Hi. Do I look fat today?" 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.10,0:05:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}珍妮斯问  "我今天看起来胖吗" 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I looked at her...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}于是我就看了看她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, wow, wow, you looked at her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等  你看了看她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:40.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You never look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:40.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你决不能迟疑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You just answer. It's like a reflex. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只能直接回答  就像条件反射一样 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:45.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Do I look fat?" "No."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:45.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"我看起来胖吗"  "不"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:50.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Is she prettier than I am?" "No."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:50.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"她比我漂亮吗"  "不"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:52.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Does size matter?" "No."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:52.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"尺寸很重要吗"  "不"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.97,0:05:54.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it works both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.97,0:05:54.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这一条男女都适用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.18,0:06:01.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you both just know this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.18,0:06:01.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些你们天生就知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:05.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, after about 30 or 40 fights,you kind of catch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:05.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}吵了大概三四十次后  你大概就领悟了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.83,0:06:07.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. For instance: 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.83,0:06:07.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  例如
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's say, Janice is coming back from a trip. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}假如珍妮斯旅行回来  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:12.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She gives you two options.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:12.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她给你两种选择
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:15.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Option one: She'll take a cab home from the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:15.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}选择一  她从机场自己打车回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:18.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or Option two: You can meet her at baggage claim. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:18.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}选择二  你在领行李的地方与她碰面  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:19.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:19.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:20.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's easy. Baggage claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:20.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简单  领行李的地方 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.99,0:06:23.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And wrong! Now you're single.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.99,0:06:23.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}错  这下你就变单身了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:28.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's actually secret option number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:28.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实是第三个秘密绝招
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:32.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You meet her at the gate. That way she knows you love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:32.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要在出舱口等她  这样她才知道你爱她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.34,0:06:34.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay,this is good. This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.34,0:06:34.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  这么说有道理  有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:36.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I have one. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:36.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  我还有一个问题  
