Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:38.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}珍妮斯晚上喜欢拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.85,0:06:41.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}at night, which I'm all for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.85,0:06:41.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然也喜欢拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:43.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you know, when you want to go to sleep, 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:43.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过到睡觉的时候  
