Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要怎样告诉她才不至于...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you know,accidentally calling her fat or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:51.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让诸如不小心说她胖之类的意外发生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, honey. I'm sorry we can't help you there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  这我们帮不了你  
