Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:15.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Very tricky business, but there is something you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:15.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很不容易解决  但也不是没办法
