Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:40.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi.  -Hi, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:40.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨  -嗨  菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:43.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you know that guy who's been following me? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:43.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道那个跟踪我的人吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.25,0:08:44.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I talked to him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.25,0:08:44.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我今天跟他说话了
