Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:57.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, his name is Malcolm, and he wasn't following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:57.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之他名叫麦尔科姆  他也不是在跟踪我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:08:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, he was,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:08:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说  他在跟踪没错  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:01.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but just 'cause he thought I was Ursula.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:01.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他要跟的是厄休拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:07.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why he couldn't just come up and talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:07.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以他不敢上前来跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.77,0:09:09.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because of the restraining order.
