Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:43.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可我没有跟踪她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:46.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I asked for the news, not the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:46.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是重点好么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi, guys. - Hi, Mon.
