Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:06.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The girl from the xerox place, buck naked...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:06.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}影印店的那个女孩  全裸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.99,0:10:09.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or a big tub of jam?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.99,0:10:09.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一大缸果酱  你选哪个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Put your hands together.
