Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:24.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What happened to your jam plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:24.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的果酱大计怎么不继续了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I figured out I'd need to charge $17 a jar just to break even.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我算过了  我每罐得卖17元才能收回成本
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:32.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I've got a new plan now. Babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:32.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我有了个新计划  生小孩
