Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你可能需要更大的罐子了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:41.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What are you talking about? - I'm talking about me having a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:41.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你胡说什么呢  -我说我打算生孩子
