Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:44.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你说真的吗  -是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.17,0:10:45.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The great thing about the jam plan 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.17,0:10:45.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}做果酱的好处在于  
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}was I was taking control of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它让我重新掌握自己的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I ask myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我扪心自问  
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:50.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"What is the most important thing to me in the world?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:50.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个世界上对我来说什么是最重要的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:53.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that's when I came up with the baby plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:53.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}于是我就想到了生孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:56.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aren't you forgetting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:56.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是不是忘了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:11:00.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is that guy's name? Dad!
