Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:05.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It took me 28 years to find one man I wanted to spend my life with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:05.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我花了28年  去找一个能托付终身的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:06.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I have to wait another 28 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:06.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我还得再等28年  
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:09.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll be 56 before I can have a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:09.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我生孩子就得56岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.49,0:11:11.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that's just stupid.
